{"chapter": "sites-cohomology", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06YL", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0002": "$0 \\to \\mathcal{F}_1 \\to \\mathcal{F}_2 \\to \\mathcal{F}_3 \\to 0$", "MATH_0003": "$$\n\\xymatrix{\n\\mathcal{F}_1 \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{G} \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{F}_2 \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{G} \\ar[r] &\n\\mathcal{F}_3 \\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\mathcal{G} \\ar[r] & 0 \\\\\n\\text{Tor}_1^\\mathcal{O}(\\mathcal{F}_1, \\mathcal{G}) \\ar[r] &\n\\text{Tor}_1^\\mathcal{O}(\\mathcal{F}_2, \\mathcal{G}) \\ar[r] &\n\\text{Tor}_1^\\mathcal{O}(\\mathcal{F}_3, \\mathcal{G}) \\ar[ull]\n}\n$$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\text{Tor}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:c8cf1b1211d857f80df6fd958ea42b0bc4a51861382d837498ad27d787760dc1", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:2c92e808425dd88042beb9d0e40796926b90e91656a66569e901b711bd613e10", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThis definition implies that for every short exact sequence\nof <MATH_0001>-modules\n<MATH_0002>\nwe have a long exact cohomology sequence\n<MATH_0003>\nfor every <MATH_0004>-module <MATH_0005>. This will be called\nthe long exact sequence of <MATH_0006> associated to the situation.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:6db3e6ad0333984f674b65e0b003ee45ae6044be8d34ac079e4d02c856a36884", "unit_id": "tag:06YL:prose-0004"}
